+# TLS Backend
+
+Nothing is recorded in this project regarding a decision on the TLS backend. There is no ADR, policy document, or changelog entry that records a current choice of TLS backend; the repository only contains ordinary usage documentation (e.g., `RunTLS` and the `gin-gonic/autotls` package) that describes how to enable TLS, not a recorded decision about which backend to use.
